# Photo Social Platform Development Roadmap
*Building a modern photo-sharing platform inspired by original Instagram and Locket*

## 🎯 Project Vision
Create a clean, minimalist photo-sharing platform that captures the essence of early Instagram with modern privacy features inspired by Locket - focusing on authentic photo sharing among close friends and family.

## ✅ Phase 1: Foundation (COMPLETED)
- [x] User Registration & Authentication
- [x] Database Architecture
- [x] Basic API Routes
- [x] Image Upload System
- [x] Photo Album Creation
- [x] Delete Functionality
- [x] JWT Authentication
- [x] CORS Configuration

---

## 🚀 Phase 2: Core Platform (HIGH PRIORITY)
*Essential features for MVP launch*

### Security & Performance
- [ ] **Secure Headers Implementation**
  - Content Security Policy (CSP)
  - X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options
  - HSTS headers
- [ ] **Rate Limiting**
  - API endpoint protection
  - Upload rate limiting
  - Login attempt limits
- [ ] **Session Management**
  - Secure session storage
  - Session timeout handling
  - Multi-device session control

### Enhanced Album Features
- [ ] **Album Management**
  - Edit album details (title, description)
  - Reorder photos within albums
  - Album privacy settings (public/friends/private)
- [ ] **Sharing System**
  - Generate shareable album links
  - Download individual images
  - Bulk download albums
- [ ] **Caption & Metadata**
  - Edit image captions
  - Add location tags
  - Timestamp display

### Social Foundation
- [ ] **Friend System**
  - Send/accept friend requests
  - Friend list management
  - Block/unblock users
- [ ] **Basic Interactions**
  - Like photos (heart reaction)
  - Simple commenting system
  - View interaction history

---

## 💡 Phase 3: Social Features (MEDIUM PRIORITY)
*Building the community aspect*

### Enhanced Social Interactions
- [ ] **Advanced Reactions**
  - Multiple reaction types (❤️, 😂, 😮, 😢, 👍)
  - Reaction analytics for users
- [ ] **Improved Commenting**
  - Threaded comments
  - Comment reactions
  - Mention friends (@username)
- [ ] **Content Sharing**
  - Share photos to other platforms
  - Internal reposting with attribution
  - Story-style temporary sharing

### Profile & Personalization
- [ ] **Profile Management**
  - Custom profile pictures
  - Bio and personal information
  - Privacy settings control
- [ ] **Content Organization**
  - Personal photo collections
  - Favorite photos system
  - Archive old content

### Discovery & Search
- [ ] **Smart Search**
  - Search by username
  - Search by image tags/captions
  - Location-based search
- [ ] **Content Discovery**
  - Similar image suggestions (cats, cafes, photography)
  - Trending hashtags
  - Friend activity feed
- [ ] **AI-Powered Features**
  - Automatic image categorization
  - Smart album suggestions
  - Content recommendations

