---

## 🎨 Design Philosophy & UI/UX Goals

### Clean, Minimalist Interface
- **Inspired by Original Instagram**: Simple, photo-first design
- **Non-cluttered Layout**: Generous white space, clear hierarchy
- **Focus on Content**: Images are the star, UI elements are subtle

### User Experience Priorities
- **Mobile-First Design**: Responsive across all devices
- **Intuitive Navigation**: Clear, consistent interaction patterns
- **Fast Loading**: Optimized image delivery and caching
- **Accessibility**: Screen reader support, keyboard navigation, alt text

### Privacy & Control
- **Granular Privacy Settings**: Control who sees what content
- **Data Transparency**: Clear privacy policy, data usage
- **User Ownership**: Easy data export, account deletion

